REST API · v1
Quiz API Documentation
Public, open REST API for managing quiz categories and questions. No authentication required.

Base URL
https://sadiks-quiz-apihub.lovable.app/api/v1

No auth required
JSON · CSV · XLSX
Success envelope
200
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "...",
  "data": { ... },
  "pagination": { "page": 1, "totalPages": 5, ... }
}

Error envelope
4xx · 5xx
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Validation failed",
  "errors": [ { "path": "name", "message": "Required" } ]
}

GET
/api/v1/categories

List all categories. Supports search and pagination.

Query parameters
search	Filter by name (substring, case-insensitive)
page	Page number (default 1)
limit	Page size (default 20, max 100)
Sample response
{
  "success": true,
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 20,
    "totalItems": 1,
    "totalPages": 1,
    "hasNext": false,
    "hasPrevious": false
  },
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "General Knowledge",
      "description": "General knowledge questions"
    }
  ]
}

POST
/api/v1/categories

Create a new category.

Request body
{
  "name": "General Knowledge",
  "description": "General knowledge questions"
}

Sample response
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Category created",
  "data": {
    "id": 1,
    "name": "General Knowledge"
  }
}

GET
/api/v1/categories/{id}

Get a single category by id.

Sample response
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "id": 1,
    "name": "General Knowledge",
    "description": "..."
  }
}

PUT
/api/v1/categories/{id}

Update a category.

Request body
{
  "name": "Updated",
  "description": "Optional"
}

Sample response
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Category updated",
  "data": {
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Updated"
  }
}

DELETE
/api/v1/categories/{id}

Delete a category and all its questions.

Sample response
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Category deleted"
}

GET
/api/v1/categories/{categoryId}/questions

Paginated questions for a category. Supports search and sort.

Query parameters
page	Page number (default 1)
limit	Page size (default 20, max 100)
search	Substring search inside question text
sort	id | mark | created_at | updated_at
order	asc | desc
Sample response
{
  "success": true,
  "pagination": {
    "page": 1,
    "limit": 20,
    "totalItems": 1,
    "totalPages": 1,
    "hasNext": false,
    "hasPrevious": false
  },
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "question": "What is Flutter?",
      "options": [
        "Framework",
        "Database",
        "Browser",
        "Operating System"
      ],
      "answerIndex": 0,
      "mark": 10
    }
  ]
}

POST
/api/v1/categories/{categoryId}/questions

Create a question in a category.

Request body
{
  "question": "What is Flutter?",
  "options": [
    "Framework",
    "Database",
    "Browser",
    "Operating System"
  ],
  "answerIndex": 0,
  "mark": 10
}

Sample response
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Question created",
  "data": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

GET
/api/v1/categories/{categoryId}/questions/random

Get random questions from a category.

Query parameters
count	How many questions (default 10, max 100)
Sample response
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "question": "What is Flutter?",
      "options": [
        "Framework",
        "..."
      ],
      "answerIndex": 0,
      "mark": 10
    }
  ]
}

GET
/api/v1/questions/{id}

Get a single question by id.

Sample response
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "id": 1,
    "categoryId": 1,
    "question": "..."
  }
}

PUT
/api/v1/questions/{id}

Update a question.

Request body
{
  "question": "...",
  "options": [
    "A",
    "B"
  ],
  "answerIndex": 0,
  "mark": 10
}

Sample response
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Question updated"
}

DELETE
/api/v1/questions/{id}

Delete a question.

Sample response
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Question deleted"
}

POST
/api/v1/categories/{categoryId}/questions/bulk-delete

Delete multiple questions by id.

Request body
{
  "ids": [
    1,
    2,
    3
  ]
}

Sample response
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Deleted 3 questions"
}

POST
/api/v1/categories/{categoryId}/questions/import

Bulk-import questions. Body is a JSON array of questions.

Request body
[
  {
    "question": "What is Flutter?",
    "options": [
      "Framework",
      "Database"
    ],
    "answerIndex": 0,
    "mark": 10
  }
]

Sample response
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Imported 1 questions",
  "data": {
    "inserted": 1
  }
}

GET
/api/v1/categories/{categoryId}/questions/export

Export all questions in a category. Returns JSON, CSV, or XLSX file.

Query parameters
format	json | csv | xlsx (default json)
